## SQ-PJL-01 | pack jam line registered: 10 jam blocks, 10 jello blocks, 10 jellos, 30 cauldrons, 22 fd jam jars, fluids
@group A
@commands Boot, grep the log for `vintagedelight` errors and `Missing model`/`missing texture` with `jam`, `jello`, `cauldron`; registry dump
@pass 10 jam blocks, 10 jello blocks, 10 jellos, 30 cauldrons, 22 `fd_*_jam_jar`, 5 new jars, 19 fluids; no missing model
@fails Vintage `jam/PackJams.java`, `tools/gen_pack_jams.py` (rerun it and `port_resources.py`)
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
shell grep -niE "vintagedelight" logs/latest.log | grep -iE "error|exception|missing|unknown" | head -20 | cut -c1-260; true
> zc2 reg block ^vintagedelight:[a-z_]+_jam_block$
> zc2 reg block ^vintagedelight:[a-z_]+_jello_block$
> zc2 reg item ^vintagedelight:[a-z_]+_jello$
> zc2 reg block ^vintagedelight:[a-z_]+_cauldron$
> zc2 reg block fd_[a-z_]+_jam_jar$
> zc2 reg item _jam_jar$
> zc2 reg fluid ^vintagedelight:
waitlog \[zc2\] reg fluid 30
expect \[zc2\] reg block \S+_jam_block\S*: 10\b
expect \[zc2\] reg block \S+_jello_block\S*: 10\b
expect \[zc2\] reg item \S+_jello\S*: 10\b
expect \[zc2\] reg block \S+_cauldron\S*: 30\b
expect \[zc2\] reg block fd_\S+: 22\b
look shell output: no vintagedelight error / missing line (models are client-side, not checked here); fluid count = 19 sources (38 with flowing ids); "5 new jars" = the jam jars of the pack line beyond Vintage's own (item _jam_jar list: ancient_fruit, banana, mulberry, strawberry and the rest; note the count)

## SQ-PJL-02 | pack jam jars cooked in the pot; no Upgrade Aquatic mulberry jam recipes; given UA jam items become Vintage's
@group A
@commands Recipe dump; give `upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_jam_bottle` and `mulberry_jam_block`, relog
@pass `creativedelight:fdcooking/{ancient_fruit,banana,mulberry,strawberry}_jam_jar`; no `upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_jam_*` or Central Kitchen bottle / mixing ids; given items become `vintagedelight:mulberry_jam_jar` / `mulberry_jam_block`
@fails CD `vintagedelight/jams.js` "Pack jam line"; swaps `merges_upgrade_aquatic_jams.json`
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
> zq recipes farmersdelightcooking/ancient_fruit_jam_jar
> zq recipes farmersdelightcooking/banana_jam_jar
> zq recipes farmersdelightcooking/mulberry_jam_jar
> zq recipes farmersdelightcooking/strawberry_jam_jar
> zq recipes upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_jam
> zq recipes mulberry_jam
> give c2b upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_jam_bottle 2
> give c2b upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_jam_block 1
sleep 3
> zp inv c2b
waitlog \[zp\] done 20
expect creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/ancient_fruit_jam_jar ->
expect creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/banana_jam_jar ->
expect creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/mulberry_jam_jar ->
expect creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/strawberry_jam_jar ->
expect recipes matching upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_jam: 0
expect \[zp\] inv c2b: .*vintagedelight:mulberry_jam_jar
expect \[zp\] inv c2b: .*vintagedelight:mulberry_jam_block
reject \[zp\] inv c2b: .*upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_jam
look the mulberry_jam list has no Central Kitchen bottle or mixing id (create_central_kitchen:*mulberry_jam*). Row id fix: fdcooking/ is now farmersdelightcooking/ (NCH id naming)
> clear c2b

