## SQ-PJL-05 | nut milk jar recipes and tags; jam / jello tags; soft fluid containers capacity 1
@group A
@commands Recipe dump; tag check; read `data/vintagedelight/moonlight/soft_fluids/*.json` in the jar
@pass `fdcooking/nut_milk_jar`, `nut_milk_jar_from_bottle`, `nut_milk_bottle_from_jar`; nut milk jar in `#forge:milk`; new jars in `#forge:jams`, new jellos in `#fruitsdelight:jello`; every soft fluid container `capacity` 1
@fails `jams.js`, `port_resources.py` `convert_soft_fluid`
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
> zq recipes nut_milk
> zq tagsof vintagedelight:nut_milk_jar
> zq itemtag forge:jams
> zq itemtag fruitsdelight:jello
waitlog itemtag fruitsdelight:jello 20
shell python3 $INST/tools/scratch_query/c2_famcheck.py softfluids $(ls mods/creativedelight-*.jar | head -1) 2>&1 | cut -c1-300
